/P 104 0 R
/E (The "Fashion Recommendation Problem" is fundamentally different from recommending movies or books. If you watch a sci-fi movie in December, you might still want to watch a sci-fi movie in July. But if you buy a heavy winter coat in December, recommending another winter coat in July is a critical system failure.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
